    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Panic Delivery!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/4377dc6e4efe71267527915165c54bde.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, how exciting! Welcome to Panic Delivery, the most wonderful (and mandatory) job opportunity for hardworking humans like you! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here at Panic Delivery, we care about efficiency\u2014and what better way to prove your worth than by braving the treacherous streets of our beautiful monster-ruled world? That\u2019s right! As a freshly recruited delivery agent, you\u2019ll get the once-in-a-lifetime chance to bring important (and totally safe!) packages to our esteemed, very hungry clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry! You won\u2019t be alone\u2014grab up to three other delivery units and work together in this thrilling 4-player online cooperative horror/comedy experience! And remember: a happy customer is a returning customer\u2026 or at least, what's left of them! \ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udce6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So put on that uniform, grab those packages, and start running\u2014we promise you won\u2019t get lost\u2026 but your limbs might!.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/418f2d1303af8ec817bd08e0474ad738.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/418f2d1303af8ec817bd08e0474ad738.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/418f2d1303af8ec817bd08e0474ad738.mp4?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: deliver packages. The execution? Not so much. Navigate through perilous environments filled with lurking dangers, all while ensuring that your cargo remains intact and your limbs uneaten. Monsters can be\u2026 difficult clients, and some of them may prefer you as a snack rather than appreciate your timely service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/ae23cd87fbfe354396a8e9f64a4b4a06.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/ae23cd87fbfe354396a8e9f64a4b4a06.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/ae23cd87fbfe354396a8e9f64a4b4a06.mp4?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with up to three friends to ensure your deliveries make it to their destinations. Proximity chat keeps you connected but also adds a layer of tension\u2014stick together to survive, or risk facing the consequences of splitting up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/8fe33eb94e95319ea3ed0d5bd5fd9b9d.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/8fe33eb94e95319ea3ed0d5bd5fd9b9d.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/8fe33eb94e95319ea3ed0d5bd5fd9b9d.mp4?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters won\u2019t always play nice. Equip yourself with a variety of tools and weapons to fend off aggressive clients. From special energy guns to trusty melee weapons, you\u2019ll have what you need to fight back\u2014if you\u2019re brave enough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/dee93288726334b067ec8b4a383d13fa.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/dee93288726334b067ec8b4a383d13fa.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/dee93288726334b067ec8b4a383d13fa.mp4?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes running is your best option. Utilize exploration and traversal tools such as guns that alter surfaces or distraction devices, and even monster repellents to outwit the dangers you face. Specialized backpacks and other equipment can help you carry more packages safely or complete your routes more efficiently.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/f313bf65121c0f57dd72a4fc27319cb9.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/f313bf65121c0f57dd72a4fc27319cb9.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/f313bf65121c0f57dd72a4fc27319cb9.mp4?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh in the face of danger! <i>Panic Delivery</i> blends creepy atmospheres and pulse-pounding moments with hilarious situations and quirky monster characters. The combination of spooky tension and absurd humor makes every session memorable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/91c46df87f85067f743b49c7eaaa873a.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/91c46df87f85067f743b49c7eaaa873a.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/91c46df87f85067f743b49c7eaaa873a.mp4?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a variety of unique and treacherous areas, including abandoned cities, dark forests, creepy factories and The (infamous) Funfair. Thanks to procedurally generated environments, no two deliveries will ever be the same\u2014each area will change every time you play, bringing new challenges and monstrous encounters to overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/85f9e52a9da6f9efa31bf4e6fbf38ac1.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/85f9e52a9da6f9efa31bf4e6fbf38ac1.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/85f9e52a9da6f9efa31bf4e6fbf38ac1.mp4?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed and care are key. Deliver packages quickly and without damage to earn bonuses and keep the clients\u2014and your monstrous bosses\u2014happy. Sloppy deliveries may cost you your reputation\u2026 or your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you deliver with courage, or will you panic and run?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your uniform, gather your team, and get ready for the most chaotic delivery job of your life in <i>Panic Delivery</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Panic Delivery!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/4377dc6e4efe71267527915165c54bde.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, how exciting! Welcome to Panic Delivery, the most wonderful (and mandatory) job opportunity for hardworking humans like you! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here at Panic Delivery, we care about efficiency\u2014and what better way to prove your worth than by braving the treacherous streets of our beautiful monster-ruled world? That\u2019s right! As a freshly recruited delivery agent, you\u2019ll get the once-in-a-lifetime chance to bring important (and totally safe!) packages to our esteemed, very hungry clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry! You won\u2019t be alone\u2014grab up to three other delivery units and work together in this thrilling 4-player online cooperative horror/comedy experience! And remember: a happy customer is a returning customer\u2026 or at least, what's left of them! \ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udce6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So put on that uniform, grab those packages, and start running\u2014we promise you won\u2019t get lost\u2026 but your limbs might!.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/418f2d1303af8ec817bd08e0474ad738.poster.avif?t=1752151347\" width=610 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887450/extras/418f2d1303af8ec817bd08e0474ad738.webm?t=1752151347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co